WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,650
Senior, great

2
00:00:01,650 --> 00:00:02,850
We can eat ribs

3
00:00:02,850 --> 00:00:04,650
Wait a minute, it's not soft yet.

4
00:00:04,650 --> 00:00:06,450
Well, okay, senior

5
00:00:07,650 --> 00:00:14,880
Senior, it’s delicious.

6
00:00:14,880 --> 00:00:17,080
This is the happiest time I've ever had eating here

7
00:00:17,080 --> 00:00:18,080
Really good

8
00:00:18,080 --> 00:00:19,480
It's different with the addition of chili pepper

9
00:00:20,480 --> 00:00:21,880
Have any of you eaten meat?

10
00:00:21,880 --> 00:00:23,680
Eat meat. Where can I find meat?

11
00:00:23,680 --> 00:00:25,080
I haven't even met a beast

12
00:00:25,080 --> 00:00:26,280
Besides, I met a wild beast

13
00:00:26,280 --> 00:00:27,480
It’s not yet certain who will eat whom.

14
00:00:27,480 --> 00:00:28,680
Do you know who my teammates are?

15
00:00:28,680 --> 00:00:29,680
English teacher

16
00:00:29,680 --> 00:00:31,680
Your boy English teacher

17
00:00:31,680 --> 00:00:33,480
My back molars are all broken, okay?

18
00:00:38,620 --> 00:00:39,620
His face is so ugly

19
00:00:41,940 --> 00:00:43,740
What a good bestie, that’s all
